ce\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013-2</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">학기 농어촌희망재단 대학장학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">농어촌희망자녀장학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">선발요강을 붙임과 같이 안내합니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013-2</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">학기 농어촌희망재단 대학장학생 신청은 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">학생 본인이 신청기간에 온라인을 통해 장학생 신청</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">을 합니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">학생 신청 기간이 끝난 후</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">학교의 심사를 거쳐 재단으로 장학생을 추천하게 되면</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">재단에서 최종 선발되는 과정을 거칩니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">따라서 신청을 하고자하는 해당 학생들은 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">선발요강과 학생메뉴얼을 참조</span></u><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">하여 다음의 신청절차로 실수없이 정확히 입력하여 신청하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">□ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">장학금 신청기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 7. 1(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 09:00 ~ 10(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">수</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-famil